(7531121, 1204075, 1647, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this scene could have been photographed differently for more effect.  Even just cropping in tighter on the children would have made it more colourful and interesting</td>', 'I wonder if this scene could have been photographed differently for more effect.  Even just cropping in tighter on the children would have made it more colourful and interesting', '2017-08-27 10:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531122, 1204280, 1647, '<td valign="top">The title makes no sense to me (perhaps you need to be a skateboarder), but I love the B&amp;W treatment of the image, the sense of motion and the general moodiness of the shot</td>', 'The title makes no sense to me (perhaps you need to be a skateboarder), but I love the B&W treatment of the image, the sense of motion and the general moodiness of the shot', '2017-08-27 10:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531123, 1204515, 1647, '<td valign="top">The title catches the mood of the image perfectly - makes me want to go canoeing (although I suspect my attempt would be less serene!)</td>', 'The title catches the mood of the image perfectly - makes me want to go canoeing (although I suspect my attempt would be less serene!)', '2017-08-27 10:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531124, 1203959, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the focus, detail and treatment of this image.  At the end of the day its just an empty swing seat, but I don''t think it could have been captured any better</td>', 'I love the focus, detail and treatment of this image.  At the end of the day its just an empty swing seat, but I don''t think it could have been captured any better', '2017-08-27 10:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531125, 1204370, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love that it''s got play equipment, children actually playing and also great colour and wonderful scenery all included in the one shot.  What a great shot to remember the children at that age!</td>', 'I love that it''s got play equipment, children actually playing and also great colour and wonderful scenery all included in the one shot.  What a great shot to remember the children at that age!', '2017-08-27 10:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531126, 1204542, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great composition and focus.  I can''t help but think it would be better with a child on it playing and smiling - but the technical execution is quite good</td>', 'Great composition and focus.  I can''t help but think it would be better with a child on it playing and smiling - but the technical execution is quite good', '2017-08-27 10:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531127, 1204532, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the exposure of this shot - it''s a bit of a stretch for "playground" but then I''m on a PC at midnight voting, so I totally understand it.</td>', 'I love the exposure of this shot - it''s a bit of a stretch for "playground" but then I''m on a PC at midnight voting, so I totally understand it.', '2017-08-27 10:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531128, 1204549, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great photo - one of relatively few in this playground challenge where the black &amp; white treatment works to the benefit of the image.  The texture in the concrete, the detail of the child - all excellent, one of my faves</td>', 'Great photo - one of relatively few in this playground challenge where the black & white treatment works to the benefit of the image.  The texture in the concrete, the detail of the child - all excellent, one of my faves', '2017-08-27 11:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531129, 1204368, 1647, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the black &amp; white treatment and the composition of this shot - perhaps an attempt to be more artistic and less literal in the interpretation, but then I''m not quite sure what I''m meant to take away from this image or the title.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the black & white treatment and the composition of this shot - perhaps an attempt to be more artistic and less literal in the interpretation, but then I''m not quite sure what I''m meant to take away from this image or the title.', '2017-08-27 11:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531130, 1204253, 1647, '<td valign="top">There''s some seriously heavy processing on this image, but I think it actually works really well for the photo.  The colour of the slides, the detail of the castle, the moody clouds and the inclusion of so many kids works to build a really excellent picture.  One of my favs for sure</td>', 'There''s some seriously heavy processing on this image, but I think it actually works really well for the photo.  The colour of the slides, the detail of the castle, the moody clouds and the inclusion of so many kids works to build a really excellent picture.  One of my favs for sure', '2017-08-27 11:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531131, 1204303, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great timing with this pic - mid-flight catch.  Did you also try a portrait crop of the right-hand-side of this image?</td>', 'Great timing with this pic - mid-flight catch.  Did you also try a portrait crop of the right-hand-side of this image?', '2017-08-27 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
