(7531771, 1204475, 114285, '<td valign="top">I photographed my dog on one of these, and considered entering it, all for about one second.   The young girl is slightly out of focus, but it''s still my top pick due to the difficulty in capturing  this type of image.</td>', 'I photographed my dog on one of these, and considered entering it, all for about one second.   The young girl is slightly out of focus, but it''s still my top pick due to the difficulty in capturing  this type of image.', '2017-08-30 04:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531898, 1204303, 43637, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2017-08-30 15:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531973, 1204475, 185757, '<td valign="top">A fun picture, well executed and a step above the static playground shots. Top 3 pick for me.</td>', 'A fun picture, well executed and a step above the static playground shots. Top 3 pick for me.', '2017-08-30 17:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531974, 1204210, 185757, '<td valign="top">I like that you tried hard to find something new and innovative in your perspective. Top 3 pick for me.</td>', 'I like that you tried hard to find something new and innovative in your perspective. Top 3 pick for me.', '2017-08-30 17:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531975, 1204303, 185757, '<td valign="top">Not much to say about this. Great moment, angle and colours, all working well together. Love it. Top 3 pick for me.</td>', 'Not much to say about this. Great moment, angle and colours, all working well together. Love it. Top 3 pick for me.', '2017-08-30 17:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531987, 1204210, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine title, wonderful photograph.  Neat story-telling that lays out both the beginning and the end.  The bottom of the slide reaches out to the viewer like a giant tongue.  This is so wonderfully thought out and composed.  The children are perfectly positioned.  Also, this is a real playground, unlike many of the entries.<br/>My favorite image in the challenge.</td>', 'Fine title, wonderful photograph.  Neat story-telling that lays out both the beginning and the end.  The bottom of the slide reaches out to the viewer like a giant tongue.  This is so wonderfully thought out and composed.  The children are perfectly positioned.  Also, this is a real playground, unlike many of the entries.My favorite image in the challenge.', '2017-08-30 18:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531994, 1204475, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes it''s a terrific image on a real playground, but what, to me, lifts this even above that is this young girl, enchantment itself.  The background, whizzing by, still feels clean.  The colors are so friendly, especially her delightful clothing.<br/>My second favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Yes it''s a terrific image on a real playground, but what, to me, lifts this even above that is this young girl, enchantment itself.  The background, whizzing by, still feels clean.  The colors are so friendly, especially her delightful clothing.My second favorite in the challenge.', '2017-08-30 18:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531995, 1204518, 173844, '<td valign="top">A charming evocation of childhood.  She sweetly owns this windswept terrain, fearlessly moving into it.  Lovely image.</td>', 'A charming evocation of childhood.  She sweetly owns this windswept terrain, fearlessly moving into it.  Lovely image.', '2017-08-30 18:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531996, 1204536, 173844, '<td valign="top">This compelling image has an elegiac air to it, kind of like The Secret Garden.  The vignette is artfully handled and lends great atmosphere overall.  The desaturated tone further enhances the mood.  Very fine.</td>', 'This compelling image has an elegiac air to it, kind of like The Secret Garden.  The vignette is artfully handled and lends great atmosphere overall.  The desaturated tone further enhances the mood.  Very fine.', '2017-08-30 18:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531998, 1204515, 173844, '<td valign="top">Kind of a playground stretch, but the image is very attractive and it sure looks like the canoer is enjoying him- or herself.  I love how that rock looms up on the left.  Very serene.</td>', 'Kind of a playground stretch, but the image is very attractive and it sure looks like the canoer is enjoying him- or herself.  I love how that rock looms up on the left.  Very serene.', '2017-08-30 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7531999, 1203995, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful day for a round, and this shot does it justice.  Birdie.</td>', 'A beautiful day for a round, and this shot does it justice.  Birdie.', '2017-08-30 18:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532000, 1204000, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, but too bad about the elephants passing through.  Rife with symbolism, the composition is well done and the muted colors are well-suited to the mood of the image.</td>', 'Very interesting, but too bad about the elephants passing through.  Rife with symbolism, the composition is well done and the muted colors are well-suited to the mood of the image.', '2017-08-30 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532001, 1204253, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lots of fun here.  I kind of like the heavy processing, makes the moment seem magical.</td>', 'Lots of fun here.  I kind of like the heavy processing, makes the moment seem magical.', '2017-08-30 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532002, 1204512, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good melancholy image. The light and dark tones are nicely sorted out.  One can only hope the seats will soon be filled with children squealing in delight.</td>', 'Good melancholy image. The light and dark tones are nicely sorted out.  One can only hope the seats will soon be filled with children squealing in delight.', '2017-08-30 18:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532006, 1204370, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great spirit of adventure here, enhanced by the incredible scenery in the background.  There''s also a home-made feel to this playground that''s very appealing.</td>', 'Great spirit of adventure here, enhanced by the incredible scenery in the background.  There''s also a home-made feel to this playground that''s very appealing.', '2017-08-30 18:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
