(7533107, 1203963, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> How do they breathe? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Short duration in the bubble.  About 5 minutes and they''re out of the bubble.  Not long enough to run out of oxygen.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: How do they breathe?  Short duration in the bubble.  About 5 minutes and they''re out of the bubble.  Not long enough to run out of oxygen.', '2017-09-04 21:57:31.000000', NULL, 0),
