(7533278, 1204535, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge <br/> <br/>You have met the challenge brief with this appropriate capture of a cooperative family enjoying the  playground horse. I have less of a problem with the crop than I do with the moment, it would have been so much better if they had all been looking into the frame with a look of joy on their faces. You have handled the exposure well on this bright day, well done Susan.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-09-05 17:08:15.</i></td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge  You have met the challenge brief with this appropriate capture of a cooperative family enjoying the  playground horse. I have less of a problem with the crop than I do with the moment, it would have been so much better if they had all been looking into the frame with a look of joy on their faces. You have handled the exposure well on this bright day, well done Susan.', '2017-09-05 18:07:08.000000', '2017-09-05 18:08:15.000000', 0),
(7533281, 1204532, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that meets the challenge <br/> <br/>I like your interesting and creative interpretation of the challenge brief. Your exposure is very good relying as it does solely on the display illumination it creates a lovely contrast between the dark and light areas. The displays themselves add interest to the image. Technically the execution of the image has been well handled, well done Fabio</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that meets the challenge  I like your interesting and creative interpretation of the challenge brief. Your exposure is very good relying as it does solely on the display illumination it creates a lovely contrast between the dark and light areas. The displays themselves add interest to the image. Technically the execution of the image has been well handled, well done Fabio', '2017-09-05 18:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7533285, 1204475, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your well deserved blue, a worthy winner. First and foremost you have captured a lovely image of your daughter that will be treasured and enjoyed for many years to come, for that alone it is priceless. For me there is a wonderful dynamic of the blurred background as she spins through an arc clearly enjoying the experience as evidenced by her lovely smile. It truly is a lovely image, well worth the bad head Mark!</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Congratulations on your well deserved blue, a worthy winner. First and foremost you have captured a lovely image of your daughter that will be treasured and enjoyed for many years to come, for that alone it is priceless. For me there is a wonderful dynamic of the blurred background as she spins through an arc clearly enjoying the experience as evidenced by her lovely smile. It truly is a lovely image, well worth the bad head Mark!', '2017-09-05 18:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7552401, 1204547, 68504, '<td valign="top">complete. I especially like the dress patterns in BW.</td>', 'complete. I especially like the dress patterns in BW.', '2018-01-12 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 0);
